  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Add onion and garlic; cook until tender but not brown, about 5 minutes. Stir in beer, sazón, white wine, hot sauce, and salt; bring to a boil. Reduce heat; simmer for 15 minutes.",
